# Go to Command lists the three Quick Add commands; choosing Quick Add to Inbox opens the panel on INBOX.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
keys :
type quick add to inbox
see Quick Add to Inbox  qi
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → INBOX
type From the palette
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
	- From the palette
END
